  "description": "THE BOLIDE OF TEAM INEOS TO DOMINATE EVERY RACE AGAINST TIME! From the experience of Pinarello and the continuous search for new successes, Pinarello Bolide TT is born. This new bike, inspired by all the peculiarities of the Bolide, has allowed a further reduction in aerodynamic drag and a significant reduction in the total weight of the bicycle (weight reduction of the frame kit greater than 350 g). On Pinarello Bolide TT, design blends with functionality: aerodynamics, lightness, stiffness and aesthetics distinguish every single element and give a unique and inimitable shape to the bicycle. Immediately evident are the new concave down tube that allows you to \"bring\" the bottle to the frame, reducing turbulence in an essential area; the sloping top tube with an optimized section; the new rear brake cover, which incorporates the technologies of the aviation industry; the aerodynamic front dropouts derived from the Bolide HR. Each of these small details allows for a further improvement in aerodynamics compared to the previous Pinarello Bolide.",
